      "title": "Missing teen hiker found dead in Australian bush after eight-day search",
      "link": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c304e2dlv20o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
      "description": "The state premier initially said Lily Hooper had been found alive before police confirmed her death.",
